  "steps": [
    "Mash together all ingredients for the filling as shown.",
    "For the garlic butter, mix together 2 tsp lite butter, melted, 1 tsp chopped garlic, chopped coriander.",
    "Gently dip a bread slice into water, press down on both sides to remove excess moisture, place some filling on one side and fold it and press the edges together. Shape it using your palms and make sure it’s completely sealed.",
